    "body": "Yes, that would be much better! I forgot that TOML allowed that.\r\n\r\nIn case anyone is looking into implementing this, multiple custom commands would look like this:\r\n\r\n```toml\r\n[[custom]]\r\ncommand = \"company_project_information\"\r\nsymbol = \"🍩\"\r\nstyle = \"green\"\r\n\r\n[[custom]]\r\ncommand = \"custom_command\"\r\nsymbol = \"😂\"\r\nstyle = \"yellow\"\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis would then produce an array of \"custom\" objects that can be parsed into individual custom commands.",
